Removed the app-level `enable_backup`, `enable_compliance`, `enable_intended`, `enable_sotagg`, `enable_plan`, `enable_deploy`, and `enable_postprocessing` settings from `PLUGINS_CONFIG` in favor of the per-`GoldenConfigSetting` fields of the same name. A deprecation warning is logged at startup while any of them remain configured.
Removed the `ENABLE_BACKUP`, `ENABLE_COMPLIANCE`, `ENABLE_INTENDED`, `ENABLE_SOTAGG`, `ENABLE_PLAN`, `ENABLE_DEPLOY`, `ENABLE_POSTPROCESSING`, and `CONFIG_FEATURES` constants from `nautobot_golden_config.utilities.constant`.
Removed the `gc_repos`, `gc_repo_prep`, and `get_repo_types_for_job` helpers from `nautobot_golden_config.jobs`, changed `get_refreshed_repos` to take a list of repositories, and renamed the `device_to_settings_map` attribute on the Golden Config jobs to `device_to_settings`. Custom jobs importing these need to be updated.
